                                "sense_id": "3225bdb5-42ca-3bd4-8a00-1345789d24f4",
                                "text": "REPORTS THE CONTINUOUS POLYGRAPHIC RECORDINGS MADE OF SS UNDERGOING DAUERSCHLAF, A PROLONGED SLEEP THERAPY USED FOR ACUTE PSYCHOSES AND OTHER CONDITIONS."
                            },
                            {
