                                "sense_id": "3225bdb5-42ca-3bd4-8a00-1345789d24f4",
                                "text": "THIS STUDY reports on continuous 70 to 96 hour polygraphic recordings from patients undergoing dauerschlaf or prolonged sleep therapy."
