                                "sense_id": "3225bdb5-42ca-3bd4-8a00-1345789d24f4",
                                "text": "We fully used the therapeutic enthusiasms of our day, with dauerschlaf, insulin, pentavalent arsenicals, and Kettering hypertherm."
                            },
                            {
